PROJECT_ANALYSIS.md

# Expo generated native folders & caches for the mobile app.
# Must live in the ROOT .gitignore: eas-cli on Windows does not apply nested
# .gitignore files, so the app-level "/android" rule is skipped and the local
# android/ (with Windows-path autolinking cache) gets uploaded to EAS.
soul-shield-mobile-app/android
soul-shield-mobile-app/ios
soul-shield-mobile-app/.expo
review.md
